ags-cd N/StrikeForceOmega
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:StrikeForceOmega/savedata
  copy WHDSaves:StrikeForceOmega/savedata savedata ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
StrikeForceOmega >NIL:
ags-cd N/StrikeForceOmega
IF EXISTS savedata
  IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:StrikeForceOmega
    makedir WHDSaves:StrikeForceOmega
  ENDIF
  copy savedata WHDSaves:StrikeForceOmega/savedata ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
